// `fs` as the repository's root entry presents it (`lib.wac` at the root) — the names other code in this
// repository imports from it, gathered from those imports on 2026-10-28. The filesystem itself is std's
// `Files` since design/system/0013 step 5; what is here is what a system needs around one.
//
// **One name per statement, deliberately.** Reachability keeps an `export { … } from` list whole, so a list
// of several names would read whatever every one of them needs when a program uses one.
// `tools/wac/libentry_test.wac` holds this file to that.

